    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981030/extras/95f7e92b7a3320d96a1d213af4e5d4b5.poster.avif?t=1718377596\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981030/extras/95f7e92b7a3320d96a1d213af4e5d4b5.webm?t=1718377596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981030/extras/95f7e92b7a3320d96a1d213af4e5d4b5.mp4?t=1718377596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>OutRoad Fury is a top-down action-rogue-lite game where you play as Leina, a metal singer. Following a demonic pact that ended badly, she sets off in search of a missing piece of her instrument !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your playground, your rules</h2>In Toxi City, use the ambiant chaos as your advantage ! Throw furniture at your enemies, push them back over barbed wire and loot buildings containing weapons and resources !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slaying waves from the underworld</h2>Sledgehammers, guitars and even traffic cones... Leina is spoilt for choice when it comes to smashing demons ! Each weapon has its own attack pattern, which can be combined with tapes that have an effect on Leina's performance !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every road-trip is its own adventure</h2>New surprises await you at every turn ! Travel through three districts of Toxi City, in which each zone is random and offers different events that can be resolved by force... or violence !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your fury</h2>Spend your collected souls in a demonic teleshop to gain power and unlock content ! Make noise with picks, ultimate skills that can turn battles in your favor !",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981030/extras/95f7e92b7a3320d96a1d213af4e5d4b5.poster.avif?t=1718377596\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981030/extras/95f7e92b7a3320d96a1d213af4e5d4b5.webm?t=1718377596\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2981030/extras/95f7e92b7a3320d96a1d213af4e5d4b5.mp4?t=1718377596\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>OutRoad Fury is a top-down action-rogue-lite game where you play as Leina, a metal singer. Following a demonic pact that ended badly, she sets off in search of a missing piece of her instrument !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Your playground, your rules</h2>In Toxi City, use the ambiant chaos as your advantage ! Throw furniture at your enemies, push them back over barbed wire and loot buildings containing weapons and resources !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Slaying waves from the underworld</h2>Sledgehammers, guitars and even traffic cones... Leina is spoilt for choice when it comes to smashing demons ! Each weapon has its own attack pattern, which can be combined with tapes that have an effect on Leina's performance !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every road-trip is its own adventure</h2>New surprises await you at every turn ! Travel through three districts of Toxi City, in which each zone is random and offers different events that can be resolved by force... or violence !<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unleash your fury</h2>Spend your collected souls in a demonic teleshop to gain power and unlock content ! Make noise with picks, ultimate skills that can turn battles in your favor !",
